OL,3,GNEWSATraditional industries and AI:
OL,4,AWhen old meets new
OL,5,
OL,6,FCarpet making may be one of the oldest
OL,7,Fskilled jobs in the world, but even
OL,8,Fthis traditional industry has begun to
OL,9,Fadopt the most modern of technologies `
OL,10,FArtificial Intelligence (AI).
OL,12,FKukoon Rugs is a family-owned firm that
OL,13,Fsells online and through some of the
OL,14,Fbiggest retail chains in the UK and
OL,15,FIreland.
OL,17,FChief Executive Paul Vallely says AI
OL,18,Fallows the business to be more
OL,19,Fcompetitive, allowing him to scale up
OL,20,Fparts of the firm that he previously
OL,21,Fwouldn't have been able to.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
